{"unit_id":"zhangzheng25__dsh-token-monitor#card-en","repo":"zhangzheng25/dsh-token-monitor","commit":"a627daf46e6ac822445e882353f70a8a81c2420a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-token-monitor adds usage stats to the DSH web sidebar. Its “today’s usage” card opens a dashboard with daily, 7-day, and 30-day totals, conversation counts, a per-model chart, and rankings. It rebuilds totals from session records, stores them locally, and supports backfill. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:173-220","src/index.js:359-384","client/bundle.js:532-558"]}
